  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline O-TORO is the brand's best-selling and most spin-oriented co-polyester string, co-developed with former ATP Top 25 professional Steve Johnson. Its hexagonal profile creates strong mechanical ball grip while powerful snapback adds rotational speed. Racketpedia laboratory testing supplied by Toroline rated O-TORO 1.23 a perfect 100/100 for spin. Manufacturer-supplied Tennis Warehouse laboratory comparisons also report significantly higher spin potential than several major performance co-polys while measuring lower stiffness than Babolat RPM Blast. O-TORO is designed for aggressive players seeking elite spin, heavy ball production and strong control without the harsh response often associated with high-spin polyester strings.",

    "zh": "Toroline O-TORO 是 TOROLINE 最畅销、同时也是品牌中最强调旋转表现的共聚酯球线，由前 ATP 世界前25球员 Steve Johnson 参与联合开发。其六边形截面负责提供强机械咬球，而高 Snapback 则进一步提升球线回弹速度与旋转输出。Toroline 提供的 Racketpedia 实验室测试中，O-TORO 1.23 的旋转评分达到满分 100/100。品牌引用的 Tennis Warehouse 实验室数据还显示，O-TORO 相比多款主流高性能聚酯线拥有显著更高的 Spin Potential，同时相较 Babolat RPM Blast 1.25 刚性更低。它特别适合大力量、快速挥拍并希望获得极高旋转、重球质和稳定控制，同时又不希望线床过硬的进攻型球员。"
  },

